#: compat/layout-block.php:367 inc/abilities.php:523
msgid "The layout was not saved because the builder cannot load it. A layout needs grids and grid_cells lists. Each grid_cells entry needs a numeric grid that points at an existing row. Each widget needs a numeric panels_info.grid and panels_info.cell that point at an existing row and cell. The layout-get ability returns layouts in this shape."
msgstr "La estructura no se guardó porque el maquetador no puede cargarla. Una estructura requiere listas de grids and grid_cells. Cada entrada de grid_cells necesita un grid numérico que apunte a una fila existente. Cada widget necesita un panels_info.grid y un panels_info.cell numéricos que apunten a una fila y a una celda existentes. La funcionalidad layout-get devuelve las estructuras con este formato."

